 "transcript": [
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung looks at his sons and then at Pear Blossom.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son returns home.",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"Well, and you will be a great man in the town and you will have a great house and a great wife,\"",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We will have silver and gold and jewels and beautiful women and we will drink and we will eat and we will not work, we will be lords of the land and we will not till it and we will not sow it and we will not reap it,\"",
  "[action] The eldest son gestures to his wife.",
  "[action] The second son enters the room.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and what is it to you and what do you care?\"",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[says] (to the second son) The eldest son invites his brother to join them.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung, the second son) Eldest son invites brothers to join him.",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits and rubs his face",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and I have lived on this land and it has fed me and it has clothed me and it has given me sons and it has given me daughters.\"",
  "[says] Wang Lung expresses his satisfaction with his life.",
  "[says] The eldest son responds with contempt.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son responds with contempt.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"You have lived on the fat of the land and you have eaten the fat and you have drunk the sweet wine and you have not lived the hard life that a man should live,\"",
  "[action] The sons dismiss the old man.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son joins the eldest son in dismissing the old man.",
  "[action] The sons leave the old man alone."
